# Legacy runtime dir (pre-rename) — ignore entirely
.interagent/

# AgentWeave runtime state — the whole directory is machine-local and never
# tracked (tasks, messages, agents, session.json, transport.json + secrets,
# watchdog pid/log, generated context). Matches at any depth, so this also
# covers hub/.agentweave/. Note: a `!` negation cannot re-include a file
# inside an ignored directory, so per-file exceptions here would be inert.
.agentweave/

# Local development
*.local
.env
.env.local

